<title>BRAZIL: RESEARCH ALERT-Aracruz maintained.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Aracruz maintained.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings said it maintained its buy rating for Brazilian pulp and paper firm Aracruz Celulose SA but cut its 1997 earnings estimate and raised its 1998 EPS estimate for the firm.</p>
<p>-- ING Barings analyst Paulo Vasconcellos said in a report the bank lowered its 1997 estimate to $0.66 per AD from $1.20 per ADR because of poor second-quarter earnings, higher costs and lower projected pulp prices for the year.</p>
</text>
